### 1.4 Sovereign Out-of-Band (OOB) Authentication

The critical failure mode of agentic systems with physical tool access (bash, file I/O, network sockets) is **Ambient Authority Abuse**. If an attacker convinces an LLM via indirect prompt injection that a command is necessary, the agent uses its ambient execution privileges to carry out the attack.

APEX completely dismantles this vulnerability through an **Out-of-Band (OOB) Dynamic Challenge-Response Protocol**:

